            "end_utf8": 4122,
            "quote": "- 没有说明 βD ∈ U。补充：βD ⊂ P(P(D))，而 P(P(D)) ∈ U。",
            "offset_convention": "zero-based half-open UTF-8 bytes"
          },
          {
